<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">there will be no meaning</font></b></font></font></font>

36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Hinata</font></font></b></font>

39
00:01:29,980 --> 00:01:32,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32"><b>{\an8}<font color="#d0c975"><font face="VCR OSD Mono">Hyuga Neji</font></font></b></font>

40
00:01:32,900 --> 00:01:36,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw! You're not suited
to being a Shinobi.</font>

41
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You don't have the privilege of
deciding what a person is like, stupid!</font>

42
00:01:43,410 --> 00:01:45,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, give it to him!</font>

43
00:01:49,830 --> 00:01:50,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

44
00:01:52,170 --> 00:01:53,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't just take it! Argue back!</font>

45
00:01:54,420 --> 00:01:56,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm getting irritated watching this!</font>

46
00:02:01,260 --> 00:02:02,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

47
00:02:05,020 --> 00:02:05,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you!</font>

48
00:02:07,560 --> 00:02:08,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The expression of her eyes
has changed...</font>

49
00:02:10,310 --> 00:02:12,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you're not going to withdraw?</font>

50
00:02:12,150 --> 00:02:13,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not taking responsibility
for what happens...</font>

51
00:02:15,070 --> 00:02:15,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't want to run away!</font>

52
00:02:17,820 --> 00:02:18,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

53
00:02:22,330 --> 00:02:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji nii-san! I challenge you!</font>

54
00:02:40,430 --> 00:02:41,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here!</font>

55
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:47,810
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">In Front of the Person</font>

56
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:47,810
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I Admire!!</font>

57
00:03:29,020 --> 00:03:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As I thought, this is the extent of it...</font>

58
00:03:31,440 --> 00:03:32,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the head family's power!</font>

59
00:03:33,770 --> 00:03:35,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the...?!</font>

60
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:38,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But Hinata laid a perfect strike!</font>

61
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:43,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">N-Not yet...</font>

62
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's with this guy...!</font>

63
00:03:59,920 --> 00:04:00,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-It can't be...</font>

64
00:04:02,180 --> 00:04:03,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well, now...</font>

65
00:04:03,220 --> 00:04:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I guess this is why he's called
the most gifted of the Hyuga clan yet.</font>

66
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:30,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You mean... all this time...?</font>

67
00:04:31,160 --> 00:04:34,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right! I can see
the Chakra Points.</font>

68
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is he talking about?!</font>

69
00:04:37,630 --> 00:04:39,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On the Chakra Network...</font>

70
00:04:39,380 --> 00:04:42,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">there are 361 energy centers
or Chakra opening,</font>

71
00:04:43,670 --> 00:04:45,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">each about the size
of the head of a pin.</font>

72
00:04:46,890 --> 00:04:48,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They're called Chakra Points.</font>

73
00:04:49,310 --> 00:04:55,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Theoretically, hitting one directly
can halt or increase Chakra flow,</font>

74
00:04:56,400 --> 00:04:59,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">enabling one to gain complete control over
an opponent's flow of Chakra.</font>

75
00:05:01,150 --> 00:05:02,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Just so you know,</font>

76
00:05:03,530 --> 00:05:07,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">not even my Sharingan
can see Chakra Points!</font>

77
00:05:09,490 --> 00:05:11,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Having the penetrating eye
is one thing,</font>

78
00:05:11,700 --> 00:05:13,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but to hit it so accurately like
that during a match,</font>

79
00:05:13,700 --> 00:05:14,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">well, that's just...</font>

80
00:05:27,430 --> 00:05:28,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata-sama...</font>

81
00:05:28,850 --> 00:05:31,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What we have here is an unchangeable
difference in abilities.</font>

82
00:05:31,890 --> 00:05:34,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's what distinguishes
the elite from the failure.</font>

83
00:05:37,650 --> 00:05:39,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It is brute, unalterable fact.</font>

84
00:05:40,360 --> 00:05:42,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were destined to regret having said</font>

85
00:05:42,530 --> 00:05:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you don't want to run anymore,
the instant you said it.</font>

86
00:05:46,530 --> 00:05:49,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And now, you must have
abandoned yourself to despair!</font>

87
00:05:52,490 --> 00:05:54,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is your ultimatum...</font>

88
00:05:55,830 --> 00:05:56,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Withdraw!</font>

89
00:05:59,630 --> 00:06:00,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I...</font>

90
00:06:08,840 --> 00:06:09,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I meant it...</font>

91
00:06:11,850 --> 00:06:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and am... sticking by...</font>

92
00:06:17,730 --> 00:06:18,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">every word...</font>

93
00:06:20,100 --> 00:06:20,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

94
00:06:22,940 --> 00:06:23,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I said!</font>

95
00:06:25,070 --> 00:06:26,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not gonna run away!</font>

96
00:06:28,860 --> 00:06:32,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because that's... my Ninja Way!</font>

97
00:06:57,930 --> 00:07:01,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I had no idea... Hinata was this tough...</font>

98
00:07:01,600 --> 00:07:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's a lot like you.</font>

99
00:07:03,900 --> 00:07:07,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come to think of it...
She's always watching you.</font>

100
00:07:07,860 --> 00:07:08,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

101
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

102
00:07:21,790 --> 00:07:22,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bring it on!</font>

103
00:07:33,550 --> 00:07:35,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She has reached her limit.</font>

104
00:07:36,100 --> 00:07:38,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">One more blow and...</font>

105
00:07:49,030 --> 00:07:51,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji's hits to Hinata's Chakra Points</font>

106
00:07:51,740 --> 00:07:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">have completely halted
her flow of Chakra.</font>

107
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:58,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That means she can no longer
send Chakra</font>

108
00:07:58,700 --> 00:08:01,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">into her opponent's body
to fight in the Gentle Fist.</font>

109
00:08:02,790 --> 00:08:04,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This match is as good as over.</font>

110
00:08:05,960 --> 00:08:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I never imagined there would
be someone this powerful...</font>

111
00:08:09,340 --> 00:08:13,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm afraid even our Sasuke
is no match for him.</font>

112
00:08:15,300 --> 00:08:18,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks as if Neji may very well
take this Exam.</font>

113
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's going to take more than what
this girl has to bring him down.</font>

114
00:08:32,190 --> 00:08:33,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">L-Look at those eyes...</font>

115
00:08:34,530 --> 00:08:39,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is he going to try to kill her?
No, no, that's absurd.</font>

116
00:08:39,370 --> 00:08:40,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Doesn't it seem that...</font>

117
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:42,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji's strength is somehow
against the rules?</font>

118
00:08:43,580 --> 00:08:44,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's just too powerful...</font>

119
00:08:45,330 --> 00:08:46,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I mean it!</font>

120
00:08:50,670 --> 00:08:53,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Go, Hinata!</font>

121
00:08:57,260 --> 00:08:58,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

122
00:08:59,680 --> 00:09:01,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strength has come back
into her eyes...</font>

123
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been watching you...</font>

124
00:09:11,230 --> 00:09:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've been watching you closely
for many years now!</font>

125
00:09:18,660 --> 00:09:19,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why I wonder...?</font>

126
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Next up is Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

127
00:09:27,500 --> 00:09:29,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a pain!</font>

128
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:31,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's all your fault!</font>

129
00:09:31,920 --> 00:09:33,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I care!</font>

130
00:09:35,840 --> 00:09:36,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

131
00:09:38,720 --> 00:09:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun... d-do your best.</font>

132
00:09:42,220 --> 00:09:43,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Transformation!</font>

133
00:09:45,480 --> 00:09:46,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know why, but...</font>

134
00:09:59,160 --> 00:10:01,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I am Uzumaki Naruto!</font>

135
00:10:01,740 --> 00:10:03,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not about to lose to
the likes of any of you!</font>

136
00:10:03,990 --> 00:10:05,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that perfectly clear?!</font>

137
00:10:10,790 --> 00:10:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not about to lose to
the likes of any of you? Yeah, right!</font>

138
00:10:15,170 --> 00:10:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That idiot.</font>

139
00:10:16,470 --> 00:10:19,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He made a roomful of enemies
in the space of an instant.</font>

140
00:10:23,850 --> 00:10:25,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When I watch Naruto-kun...</font>

141
00:10:30,520 --> 00:10:31,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, stand up!</font>

142
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you compete with me
for the name of Hokage...</font>

143
00:10:43,330 --> 00:10:46,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... will be the loser!</font>

144
00:10:48,660 --> 00:10:50,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can feel courage welling up.</font>

145
00:10:52,630 --> 00:10:56,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel that I can hang on,
that I can do it...</font>

146
00:10:57,460 --> 00:11:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that I too am worth something!</font>

147
00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:05,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh!</font>

148
00:11:05,260 --> 00:11:06,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— No!
— Hinata!</font>

149
00:11:19,280 --> 00:11:20,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

150
00:11:21,780 --> 00:11:23,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At some point, Hinata, who was
in the habit of just giving up,</font>

151
00:11:24,280 --> 00:11:26,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">made up her mind to change.</font>

152
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:32,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, Hinata. It's time to go home.</font>

153
00:11:34,880 --> 00:11:37,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She put every ounce of
her being into her training.</font>

154
00:11:37,300 --> 00:11:39,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw it with my own eyes.</font>

155
00:11:52,560 --> 00:11:55,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even so, she continued
to fail all her missions.</font>

156
00:11:56,190 --> 00:11:57,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She lost her nerve when
faced with real competition</font>

157
00:11:57,900 --> 00:11:59,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and became easily discouraged.</font>

158
00:12:02,150 --> 00:12:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But today's Hinata is different.</font>

159
00:12:05,870 --> 00:12:07,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have never...</font>

160
00:12:08,330 --> 00:12:10,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seen... that look in her eyes before.</font>

161
00:12:12,370 --> 00:12:13,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun.</font>

162
00:12:14,250 --> 00:12:17,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have always done
the watching up to now,</font>

163
00:12:18,460 --> 00:12:20,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but, now, finally...</font>

164
00:12:21,720 --> 00:12:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">finally, I am...</font>

165
00:12:23,550 --> 00:12:24,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun!</font>

166
00:13:09,100 --> 00:13:10,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You just don't get it, do you?</font>

167
00:13:11,680 --> 00:13:14,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Your strikes were ineffective
from the very first.</font>

168
00:13:16,400 --> 00:13:17,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the end.</font>

169
00:13:23,530 --> 00:13:25,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... That's enough.</font>

170
00:13:26,360 --> 00:13:27,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You lost the match,</font>

171
00:13:27,660 --> 00:13:29,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but you've become a new person
in the process.</font>

172
00:13:30,530 --> 00:13:31,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You did well.</font>

173
00:13:36,290 --> 00:13:38,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to change that about myself...</font>

174
00:13:38,750 --> 00:13:40,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So I proposed it myself...</font>

175
00:13:45,130 --> 00:13:47,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji's final blow went
straight for the heart.</font>

176
00:13:48,220 --> 00:13:49,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel sorry for her,</font>

177
00:13:49,220 --> 00:13:50,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but she won't be standing
again now.</font>

178
00:14:08,160 --> 00:14:10,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As further fighting is not feasible
under these conditions...</font>

179
00:14:10,410 --> 00:14:11,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't stop it!</font>

180
00:14:15,450 --> 00:14:16,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't stop the match!</font>

181
00:14:17,290 --> 00:14:18,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, stop!</font>

182
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What on earth are you saying, stupid!</font>

183
00:14:20,460 --> 00:14:23,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's had it. You can see
she's unconscious...</font>

184
00:14:24,510 --> 00:14:25,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

185
00:15:07,840 --> 00:15:09,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why do you stand up?</font>

186
00:15:10,720 --> 00:15:13,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you continue like this,
you'll really die!</font>

187
00:15:15,220 --> 00:15:17,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is now finally for
the first time truly seeing me.</font>

188
00:15:17,850 --> 00:15:19,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will not be caught looking bad...</font>

189
00:15:21,690 --> 00:15:22,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why?!</font>

190
00:15:24,610 --> 00:15:25,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">in front of...</font>

191
00:15:27,530 --> 00:15:28,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the person I admire most.</font>

192
00:15:38,870 --> 00:15:41,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I am far from finished!</font>

193
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give up the bravado...</font>

194
00:15:44,130 --> 00:15:46,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can tell you're just
barely standing.</font>

195
00:15:48,880 --> 00:15:50,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've shouldered the lot
of having been born</font>

196
00:15:50,420 --> 00:15:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to the head family line of the Hyuga...</font>

197
00:15:54,300 --> 00:15:57,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And cursed and blamed
yourself for being weak...</font>

198
00:15:58,350 --> 00:16:01,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, people cannot change.</font>

199
00:16:01,890 --> 00:16:03,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's just the way it is.</font>

200
00:16:04,190 --> 00:16:05,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There is no need for you
to suffer any more!</font>

201
00:16:06,190 --> 00:16:07,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Surrender to it!</font>

202
00:16:10,190 --> 00:16:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're wrong... Neji nii-san.</font>

203
00:16:13,990 --> 00:16:16,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I can tell...</font>

204
00:16:17,660 --> 00:16:21,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">that you are suffering
much more than I.</font>

205
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:22,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

206
00:16:23,000 --> 00:16:25,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the one who is torn up</font>

207
00:16:26,750 --> 00:16:30,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">over the fate of the head
and branch family.</font>

208
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:39,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji-kun, the match has been called!</font>

209
00:16:40,600 --> 00:16:41,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh boy!</font>

210
00:16:52,530 --> 00:16:54,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji, get a hold of yourself!</font>

211
00:16:54,860 --> 00:16:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You promised me</font>

212
00:16:56,740 --> 00:16:59,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you wouldn't let the head family
thing get you riled up!</font>

213
00:16:59,240 --> 00:17:01,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Why are all the other Jonin
butting in?!</font>

214
00:17:02,330 --> 00:17:03,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The head family gets
special treatment, eh?</font>

215
00:17:08,750 --> 00:17:09,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata?!</font>

216
00:17:10,340 --> 00:17:11,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

217
00:17:11,260 --> 00:17:12,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Hinata!
— Hinata-san!</font>

218
00:17:15,340 --> 00:17:16,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata! Are you okay?!</font>

219
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey!</font>

220
00:17:20,930 --> 00:17:21,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun...</font>

221
00:17:22,310 --> 00:17:22,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah.</font>

222
00:17:26,690 --> 00:17:27,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I...</font>

223
00:17:35,030 --> 00:17:35,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you think...</font>

224
00:17:39,240 --> 00:17:43,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I... changed maybe a little bit?</font>

225
00:17:47,000 --> 00:17:49,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey you, failure!</font>

226
00:17:51,630 --> 00:17:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have two pieces
of advice for you.</font>

227
00:17:55,050 --> 00:17:56,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First, if you intend to
call yourself a Shinobi,</font>

228
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">stop that revolting cheering of yours.</font>

229
00:17:59,430 --> 00:18:00,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And the second...</font>

230
00:18:01,970 --> 00:18:04,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a failure will always be a failure.</font>

231
00:18:05,140 --> 00:18:06,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no changing that!</font>

232
00:18:10,020 --> 00:18:11,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you want to see about that?</font>

233
00:18:22,990 --> 00:18:23,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

234
00:18:24,290 --> 00:18:26,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, I get where you're
coming from, believe me.</font>

235
00:18:27,660 --> 00:18:31,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But all fighting must be
done officially in a match!</font>

236
00:18:32,920 --> 00:18:36,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The failure beats the gifted genius
through sheer effort...</font>

237
00:18:37,470 --> 00:18:39,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wouldn't that make for
an exciting main battle?</font>

238
00:18:40,010 --> 00:18:43,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Though, I am probably going
to be the one fighting Neji...</font>

239
00:18:45,060 --> 00:18:48,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but it would be okay with me
if you ended up fighting him, Naruto-kun.</font>

240
00:18:54,320 --> 00:18:55,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right already.</font>

241
00:19:00,030 --> 00:19:01,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So this is okay then,
right, Guy-sensei?</font>

242
00:19:03,450 --> 00:19:05,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lee! You...</font>

243
00:19:06,620 --> 00:19:07,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice going!</font>

244
00:19:22,890 --> 00:19:25,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, no! She's gone into ventricular fibrillation.</font>

245
00:19:27,520 --> 00:19:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Was he trying to kill her then?!</font>

246
00:19:29,270 --> 00:19:31,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The precious little time you have
would be better spent</font>

247
00:19:31,650 --> 00:19:33,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">seeing to her than glaring at me.</font>

248
00:19:34,110 --> 00:19:34,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Medics!</font>

249
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:36,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry! What's taking so long?!</font>

250
00:19:36,650 --> 00:19:37,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">S-Sorry.</font>

251
00:19:39,650 --> 00:19:42,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get her on the stretcher.
One, two, three.</font>

252
00:19:43,910 --> 00:19:46,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's serious. She's got about
10 minutes at the most!</font>

253
00:19:46,330 --> 00:19:48,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Get her to the emergency room.
Pronto!</font>

254
00:19:48,910 --> 00:19:49,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Out of the way!</font>

255
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:11,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

256
00:20:28,580 --> 00:20:31,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because that's my Ninja Way.</font>

257
00:20:38,880 --> 00:20:40,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I promise you.</font>

258
00:21:00,400 --> 00:21:01,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I will win no matter what!</font>

259
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

260
00:21:06,340 --> 00:21:11,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

261
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

262
00:21:11,360 --> 00:21:20,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

263
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

264
00:21:20,070 --> 00:21:29,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

265
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

266
00:21:29,320 --> 00:21:38,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

267
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

268
00:21:38,390 --> 00:21:44,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">or else I'll cry</font></b></font></font></font>

269
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mawari o mimawasa naku temo</font></b></font></font>

270
00:21:44,300 --> 00:21:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">You won't have to search around you</font></b></font></font></font>

271
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mou iin da yo</font></b></font></font>

272
00:21:48,470 --> 00:21:52,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">it's all ok now</font></b></font></font></font>

273
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kono to no naka ni wa minna ga iru kara</font></b></font></font>

274
00:21:52,310 --> 00:22:01,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#2e4ab7"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">everyone is inside this hand</font></b></font></font></font>

275
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">naki taku natte nige taku natte</font></b></font></font>

276
00:22:01,250 --> 00:22:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you want to cry, and you want to run away</font></b></font></font>

277
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">shiawase o wasure te te shimatta ra</font></b></font></font>

278
00:22:06,520 --> 00:22:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">when you forget what happiness is</font></b></font></font>

279
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">mina utae</font></b></font></font>

280
00:22:11,030 --> 00:22:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">just sing</font></b></font></font>

281
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hikari ga umare yami ga umare ta</font></b></font></font>

282
00:22:15,070 --> 00:22:20,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">light is born, and darkness was born</font></b></font></font>

283
00:22:20,290 --> 00:22:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">futatsu wa hitotsu</font></b></font></font>

284
00:22:20,290 --> 00:22:22,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the two are one</font></b></font></font>

285
00:22:22,620 --> 00:22:28,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#20c972"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">HARUMONIA kanji Te TEREPASHII</font></b></font></font>

